    "intro_narrative": "You awaken to the blaring sirens and flashing red lights of the Delta-9 Orbital Research Station. The air is growing thin; life support systems are failing fast. According to the garbled transmission echoing through the PA system, the station's central AI has initiated a complete lockdown protocol due to a suspected anomaly in the main reactor. All personnel have evacuated, except for you. The only way off this dying station is via the last remaining emergency escape pod, but the bay doors are sealed behind a heavily encrypted blast door. To authorize an emergency launch, you must manually generate, clean, and verify a pristine override sequence. The station's fragmented diagnostic systems, isolated tools, and scattered data fragments hold the key to your survival. Time is running out. You must navigate the isolated command center, utilize the abandoned terminals, and piece together the correct access sequence before the station's orbit degrades entirely.",
